@host = http://localhost:5000

GET {{host}}/health

### Whole dataset from memory cache
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places

### Force a full upstream refresh first (globally cooldown-limited)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places?forceRefresh=true

### Viewport / bbox
GET {{host}}/api/v1/places?minLat=49.8&maxLat=50.2&minLon=21.8&maxLon=22.2

### Dataset metadata
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dataset
